en-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Simon</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Transcriptional regulatory networks in <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic>.</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2002</year><volume>298</volume><fpage>799</fpage><lpage>804</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12399584</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><fig position="float" id="F1"><label>The bottom line</label><graphic xlink:href="1475-4924-2-9-1"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F2"><label>Background</label><graphic xlink:href="1475-4924-2-9-2"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F3"><label>Behind the scenes</label><graphic xlink:href="1475-4924-2-9-3"/></fig></sec></back></article>